---
  NO  switch   generations/current could not be read: <the error>
  NO  journal  could not be read: <the error>
  NO  rescue   /s/rescue.sh could not be read: <the error>
  NO  links    /h/.config/a: the plan linked it to /p/a, and it could not be read: <the error>
               /h/.config/b: the ledger has no row for it
               /h/.config/c: the plan retired it, and the ledger still has a row for it
               /h/.config/d: the plan linked it to /p/d, and nothing is there
  ok  lock     this ricepilot holds /r/ricepilot.lock, and it is still the file at that path
  NO  session  the Wayland socket could not be looked at: <the error>
               systemd's record of running units could not be read (<the error>), and it is the one
               read-only way ricepilot has to see that uwsm manages this session
